 indi_<brand>_ccd, indi_<brand>_wheel and indi_<brand>_focuser for all
 eleven Touptek-family brands (Toupcam, Altair, Bresser, Mallincam, Meade,
 Nncam, Ogmacam, Omegon, StarShootG, TSCam, SVBONYCAM), linked against the
 bundled SDKs (indi-stable-3rdparty-libs-touptek).
 .
 This is an unofficial third-party build. It is not affiliated with or
